    {
      "text": "发射球撞击骰子得分，球反弹回来还能继续增加分数，把台球轨迹变成连续计分链",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In STICKER/BALL you fire balls . Hit dice with the balls to earn points, and ricochet back for even more.",
