      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "贴纸会产生连锁生态：便便吸引苍蝇、蜘蛛结网，而蛛网再捕捉苍蝇换取额外得分",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Stickers can interact in strange ways. For example, poop attracts flies. Spiders make webs. Spider webs catch flies. More points for you!",
